      "outcome": "For the two unit-induced maps A,B: Aut(1)->Aut(X), naturality of c_{1,X} and r_X c_{1,X}=l_X imply A(u)=B(u). Hence the action arising from their ratio on Aut(1)=pi_1 is trivial in the ACU setting. This confirms the target expected from the preceding construction, while the written subscript remains 0|1."
